  <text xml:lang="la">
    <front>
      <div xml:id="starts-on">
        <pb ed="#P" n="1286D"/>
      </div>
    </front>
    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is44">
        <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e98">Caput 44</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_1@1-4">Et nunc audi, Jacob.</quote>
            Primos fideles de Judaeis aliis obduratis cum quodam privilegio nominis et dignitate honoris alloquitur; apostolorum scilicet chorum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e110">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e112" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_1@3-6">Audi, Jacob serve meus.</quote>
            Prima servitus, secunda electio.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e117">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e119">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e121">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e123" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_2@8-11">Ab utero auxiliator tuus.</quote>
            In quo fratris plantam arripuisti, vel, in principio Ecclesiae manus persecutorum evasisti.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_2@17-20">Et rectissime quem elegi.</quote>
            Israel, secundum Hebraicam veritatem, rectus vel rectissimus. Quod ante, vir <pb ed="#P" n="1287A"/> videns Deum dicitur: non a proprietate, sed a sono vocis habetur.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e136">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e138">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e140">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e142" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_3@10-12">Effundam Spiritum meum.</quote>
            Scilicet in baptismo per impositionem manuum.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e149">Versus 4</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_4@5-9">Quasi salices juxta praeterfluentes aquas.</quote>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e156"><seg type="qs">Salix arbor infructuosa</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quae cito credidit praedicantibus apostolis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e166">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e168">Versus 5</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e170">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e172" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_5@1-2">Iste dicet.</quote>
            Credentium varietatem describit.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e176">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e178" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_5@18-22">Et in nomine Israel assimilabitur.</quote>
            Ut recipiant legem, et prophetas, et Spiritus sancti gratias quae Israeli promissae sunt.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e183">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e185">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e187">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e189" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_6@11-15">Ego primus et ego novissimus.</quote>
            Post vocationem gentium quae, abjectis idolis, crediderunt, agit contra eos qui converti noluerunt.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e193">
            <pb ed="#P" n="1287B"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e197" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_6@17-21">Absque me non est Deus.</quote>
            Non dicit se solum esse, sed praeter virtutem et sapientiam suam nullum externum Deum esse, deorum multorum opinionem et simulacra condemnans.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e204">Versus 12</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_12@20-22">Esuriet et deficiet.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is44-Rd1e211"><name xml:id="gom-is44-Nd1e212" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e215"><seg type="qs">Fame et siti artificis</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quorum Deus venter est, gloria in confusione eorum.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e224">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e226">Versus 23</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e228">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e230" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_23@6-8">Jubilate, extrema terrae.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is44-Rd1e233"><name xml:id="gom-is44-Nd1e234" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e237">Angeli quasi habitatoribus terrae praesunt; vel apostoli, vel prophetae super quos et alii esse constant; unde Ephesiis dicitur: <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e239" source="http://scta.info/resource/eph2_20@1-6">Super aedificati super fundamentum apostolorum et prophetarum,</quote> etc.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e245">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e247">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e249">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e251" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_24@1-4">Haec dicit Dominus Redemptor,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is44-Rd1e254"><name xml:id="gom-is44-Nd1e255" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e258">Supra locutus est de idolorum subversione, et Israel poenitentis redemptione: nunc autem de potentiae <pb ed="#P" n="1287C"/> suae magnitudine, ne quis dubitet de salvatione quam promittit.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e265">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e267">Versus 26</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e269">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e271" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_26@10-11">Qui dico.</quote>
            De restauratione quae facta est a Zorobabel et aliis ducibus, Cyro permittente, loquitur: Cum tamen adhuc implenda esset captivitas.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is44-Dd1e277">
          <head xml:id="gom-is44-Hd1e279">Versus 27</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is44-d1e281">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is44-Qd1e283" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is44_27@6-7">Flumina tua.</quote>
            Sub Dario scilicet et Cyro nepote ejus. Nocte enim qua ab eis Balthasar occisus est, Euphrates fluvius, qui per mediam civitatem fluebat, ab eorum exercitu in rivos divisus est, ut per ejus alveum civitatem ingrederentur.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
